  "details": "Currently you are only able to see a total of 5 instances. I think the number of instances shown should be increased. Back in 2018 there use to be more shown however this was limited down to the 5 we currently have. Currently on both the live and beta versions of the game instances shown for worlds don't feel randomized and when instance hopping in worlds you often rejoin the same instance. There should also be some type of marker to show the last 3 instances you have joined to prevent rejoining previous instances.",
